<section>
<title>Detailed Description</title>

<para>The root structure of the imported data.</para>

<para>Everything that was imported from the given file can be accessed from here. Objects of this class are generally maintained and owned by <link linkend="_namespace_assimp">Assimp</link>, not by the caller. You shouldn&apos;t want to instance it, nor should you ever try to delete a given scene on your own. </para>
</section>
