<para><computeroutput><link linkend="_defs_8h_1ab51df4230ceb602bbc1bc109c432a6a0">C_STRUCT</link> <link linkend="_structai_animation">aiAnimation</link>** aiScene::mAnimations</computeroutput></para>
<para>The array of animations.</para>

<para>All animations imported from the given file are listed here. The array is mNumAnimations in size. </para>
</section>
<anchor xml:id="_structai_scene_1a71e7d204d96969ca4f5a931f4d636f1e"/><section>
    <title>mCameras</title>
<indexterm><primary>mCameras</primary><secondary>aiScene</secondary></indexterm>
