<para><computeroutput><link linkend="_defs_8h_1ab51df4230ceb602bbc1bc109c432a6a0">C_STRUCT</link> <link linkend="_structai_camera">aiCamera</link>** aiScene::mCameras</computeroutput></para>
<para>The array of cameras.</para>

<para>All cameras imported from the given file are listed here. The array is mNumCameras in size. The first camera in the array (if existing) is the default camera view into the scene. </para>
</section>
<anchor xml:id="_structai_scene_1a4091f10bb81e05db00ebc34f40c48f38"/><section>
    <title>mFlags</title>
