<para>The array of materials.</para>

<para>Use the index given in each <link linkend="_structai_mesh">aiMesh</link> structure to access this array. The array is mNumMaterials in size. If the AI_SCENE_FLAGS_INCOMPLETE flag is not set there will always be at least ONE material. </para>
</section>
